DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: The OSG aims to act upon at least 98% of referred cases in 2027

asr-000498
00:31:51.020 --> 00:31:55.240
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: out of which 99% are acted upon within 30 days.

asr-000499
00:31:55.240 --> 00:32:02.000
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: For resolution of petitions for naturalization, the agency intends to resolve 100% by the end of the year.

asr-000500
00:32:02.540 --> 00:32:08.360
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: For the PPA, the 2027 recommended budget amounts to 1.25 billion

asr-000501
00:32:08.360 --> 00:32:15.660
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: which is about 3.61% lower than the 1.3 billion approved budget in 2026.

asr-000502
00:32:16.100 --> 00:32:23.080
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: With their 2027 NEP-based budget, the PPA will ensure 98.96% of their clients

asr-000503
00:32:23.080 --> 00:32:25.100
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: will be compliant with the terms of the PPA.

asr-000504
00:32:25.240 --> 00:32:41.660
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: For the PCGG, the recommended budget under the 2027 NEP amounts to 339 million

asr-000505
00:32:41.660 --> 00:32:47.200
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: which is 9.35% higher than their current year appropriations of 310 million.

asr-000506
00:32:47.200 --> 00:32:55.200
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: For 2027, the PCGG targets at least 846 million of surrendered or sequestered

asr-000507
00:32:55.240 --> 00:32:57.840
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: assets to be submitted to the Bureau of Treasury.

asr-000508
00:32:58.560 --> 00:33:04.740
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: For the Public Attorney's Office, their 2027 recommended budget amounts to 7.101 billion

asr-000509
00:33:04.740 --> 00:33:11.480
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: which is 6.10% higher than their 6.693 billion budget for 2026.

asr-000510
00:33:12.040 --> 00:33:17.740
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: With this recommended budget, the PAO will be able to achieve 83.05% favorable judgments

asr-000511
00:33:17.740 --> 00:33:21.540
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: for its disposed cases including appeals in 2027.

asr-000512
00:33:22.240 --> 00:33:25.220
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: Said office will also ensure that all requests for non-judicial,

asr-000513
00:33:25.240 --> 00:33:29.440
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: services in 2027 will be acted upon within two hours.

asr-000514
00:33:29.960 --> 00:33:33.240
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: Lastly, for the Office of the Alternative Dispute Resolution,

asr-000515
00:33:34.140 --> 00:33:37.800
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: the 2027 recommended budget amounts to 139 million

asr-000516
00:33:37.800 --> 00:33:43.320
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: which is 16.27% lower than their current year's appropriation.

asr-000517
00:33:43.840 --> 00:33:50.080
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: Despite the reduced funding, the OADR will ensure that 1,880 ADR practitioners

asr-000518
00:33:50.080 --> 00:33:55.040
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: and implementers will be trained and 100% of applications for accreditation

asr-000519
00:33:55.240 --> 00:33:57.640
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: will be acted upon in 2027.

asr-000520
00:33:58.420 --> 00:34:03.040
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: This concludes our presentation of the 2027 Department-wide Budget.

asr-000521
00:34:03.460 --> 00:34:06.100
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: At this point, we are ready to address any questions, comments,

asr-000522
00:34:06.240 --> 00:34:09.400
DOJ Undersecretary Majken Anika S. Gran-Ong: or requests for clarifications from the members of this committee.

