Senator Panfilo Lacson: Apparently, there's a mathematical error.

asr-000536
00:34:47.600 --> 00:34:48.720
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kasi when we computed,

asr-000537
00:34:48.720 --> 00:34:55.080
Senator Panfilo Lacson: ang data nyo rito is 428,779 cases,

asr-000538
00:34:55.240 --> 00:34:57.620
Senator Panfilo Lacson: this was in 2025.

asr-000539
00:34:58.140 --> 00:35:03.020
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ang na-dispose or resolved

asr-000540
00:35:03.920 --> 00:35:07.740
Senator Panfilo Lacson: And you computed it at 99.12%.

asr-000541
00:35:07.740 --> 00:35:11.940
