asr-000543
00:35:15.700 --> 00:35:16.900
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Pakiclarify lang nga.

asr-000544
00:35:17.640 --> 00:35:22.120
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Malaki yung discrepancy kasi between 99.12 and 92.3,

asr-000545
00:35:23.160 --> 00:35:24.420
Senator Panfilo Lacson: medyo malaki po.

asr-000546
00:35:24.720 --> 00:35:25.120
Senator Panfilo Lacson: At kung kailangan,

asr-000547
00:35:25.240 --> 00:35:26.740
