PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: shall be dispersed for the special allowances of authorized officials,

asr-000988
00:51:48.580 --> 00:51:49.560
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: lawyers of the PAO.

asr-000989
00:51:50.280 --> 00:51:51.520
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: Hindi pa rin namin nakuha.

asr-000990
00:51:51.520 --> 00:51:55.960
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: Pati po yung upgrading ng senior para equivalent sa napros,

asr-000991
00:51:55.960 --> 00:51:58.460
PAO Chief Persida V. Rueda-Acosta: hindi pa rin po natutupad ng DBM.

