Senator Panfilo Lacson: papunta sa...

asr-001059
00:55:08.900 --> 00:55:09.520
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Galing sa inyo.

asr-001060
00:55:09.960 --> 00:55:10.360
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Part.

asr-001061
00:55:10.500 --> 00:55:11.280
PCGG Chairperson Melchor Quirino C. Sadang: Part of it.

asr-001062
00:55:11.480 --> 00:55:12.760
