Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Hindi.

asr-003184
01:49:33.920 --> 01:49:38.220
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: 90% of the cases, walang certified true copy.

asr-003185
01:49:39.520 --> 01:49:41.940
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, and then I told that to Attorney Ong.

asr-003186
01:49:42.040 --> 01:49:42.320
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: I said,

asr-003187
01:49:42.860 --> 01:49:46.220
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: pwede ba kayo mag-usap ng DOJ at ng BOC?

asr-003188
01:49:46.960 --> 01:49:48.400
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Eh, kayo yung nagpa-prosecute.

asr-003189
01:49:48.400 --> 01:49:50.400
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Tapos yung dokumentong galing sa...

asr-003190
01:49:51.100 --> 01:49:51.960
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Simple-simple lang.

asr-003191
01:49:51.980 --> 01:49:54.380
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Another thing, Sekretary,

asr-003192
01:49:54.480 --> 01:49:55.840
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: pag-aralan ninyo ng husto,

asr-003193
01:49:57.320 --> 01:49:58.720
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: nire-report sa media,

asr-003194
01:49:59.520 --> 01:50:01.000
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: kumpiskado, 9 million.

asr-003195
01:50:02.040 --> 01:50:03.580
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Worth of agri-products,

asr-003196
01:50:03.680 --> 01:50:05.360
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: kumpiskado, 6 million.

asr-003197
01:50:05.940 --> 01:50:07.500
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Sabi ko, ang convenient naman,

asr-003198
01:50:07.640 --> 01:50:08.980
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: puro below 10 million.

asr-003199
01:50:09.900 --> 01:50:09.980
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Yeah.

asr-003200
01:50:10.700 --> 01:50:12.400
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Wala, puro available.

asr-003201
01:50:14.880 --> 01:50:16.620
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Di ba? Parang, ano to?

asr-003202
01:50:18.260 --> 01:50:19.740
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Di ba? So, yun din,

asr-003203
01:50:19.740 --> 01:50:21.400
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: ang kinangan yung pag-aralan, di ba?

asr-003204
01:50:21.980 --> 01:50:27.840
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Nakakaroon ng dagdag-bawas doon sa halaga.

asr-003205
01:50:29.160 --> 01:50:30.080
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Go ahead, sir. Go ahead.

asr-003206
01:50:30.320 --> 01:50:31.120
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Well, well, well.

asr-003207
01:50:31.300 --> 01:50:33.460
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Binansiyon nyo lang po ay caught my attention

asr-003208
01:50:33.460 --> 01:50:36.160
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: because when I arrived po sa NBI,

asr-003209
01:50:36.380 --> 01:50:38.620
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: yung huli namin, more than 10 million lahat eh.

asr-003210
01:50:38.680 --> 01:50:40.320
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: We have onion, 37 million.

asr-003211
01:50:40.980 --> 01:50:42.880
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: So, yung manok po yata, 12 billion ngayon.

asr-003212
01:50:43.000 --> 01:50:44.320
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yun ang una ko tinitingnan eh.

asr-003213
01:50:44.440 --> 01:50:46.800
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Pag nababasa ko sa dyaryo, magkano ito?

asr-003214
01:50:46.900 --> 01:50:49.220
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Dahil kung mas mababa sa 10 million ito,

asr-003215
01:50:49.280 --> 01:50:50.000
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: drawing lang ito.

asr-003216
01:50:50.000 --> 01:50:51.100
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Ah, yan po.

asr-003217
01:50:51.420 --> 01:50:51.620
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Di ba?

asr-003218
01:50:51.980 --> 01:50:53.500
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Pero meron pa nangyayari,

asr-003219
01:50:53.900 --> 01:50:55.440
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: nai-report ng 10 million,

asr-003220
01:50:55.700 --> 01:50:57.740
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: abab, pero pagdating doon sa kasuhan,

asr-003221
01:50:59.060 --> 01:51:00.280
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: ano, pumayat na.

asr-003222
01:51:01.360 --> 01:51:03.040
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Kumaga, lumiit na na.

asr-003223
01:51:03.560 --> 01:51:03.940
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Bumaba.

asr-003224
01:51:05.740 --> 01:51:07.640
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Sen, if I may interject something.

asr-003225
01:51:07.700 --> 01:51:08.820
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes, but, yeah.

asr-003226
01:51:09.040 --> 01:51:12.000
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Very quickly lang because Senator Lacson has a second hand.

asr-003227
01:51:12.000 --> 01:51:13.540
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Quickly lang po on this matter.

asr-003228
01:51:13.940 --> 01:51:15.920
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: We already initiated something.

asr-003229
01:51:16.020 --> 01:51:18.280
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Other than that tripartite agreement,

asr-003230
01:51:19.120 --> 01:51:21.280
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: pag nagdi-dismiss po ako ngayon,

asr-003231
01:51:21.980 --> 01:51:23.700
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: petitions for review and PI,

asr-003232
01:51:24.400 --> 01:51:26.380
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: we also mandate,

asr-003233
01:51:26.560 --> 01:51:30.280
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: we give it back to the BOC or even the BIR

asr-003234
01:51:30.280 --> 01:51:33.400
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: to resubmit subject to the rules of prescription.

asr-003235
01:51:34.060 --> 01:51:36.520
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: To submit within a certain period of time,

asr-003236
01:51:36.520 --> 01:51:38.520
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: to resubmit the documents

asr-003237
01:51:38.520 --> 01:51:41.540
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: and to pursue the filing of cases

asr-003238
01:51:41.540 --> 01:51:42.780
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: against the possible,

asr-003239
01:51:43.560 --> 01:51:46.020
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: the individuals who would be responsible.

asr-003240
01:51:46.740 --> 01:51:48.720
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: And may engagement na rin po ako doon

asr-003241
01:51:48.720 --> 01:51:49.420
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: kay Ombudsman.

asr-003242
01:51:49.960 --> 01:51:50.480
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Sabi niya,

asr-003243
01:51:50.480 --> 01:51:52.340
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: pag hindi nila kinumply,

asr-003244
01:51:52.560 --> 01:51:53.680
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: dereliction of duty.

asr-003245
01:51:54.340 --> 01:51:56.620
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: So, yun po ang push namin ngayon.

asr-003246
01:51:56.780 --> 01:51:58.660
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: So, meron na po kaming timelines

asr-003247
01:51:58.660 --> 01:52:00.420
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: na binigay doon sa mga officials.

asr-003248
01:52:00.960 --> 01:52:02.200
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Identified naman po kasi

asr-003249
01:52:02.200 --> 01:52:05.860
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: kung sino yung mga officials na nag-file.

asr-003250
01:52:06.440 --> 01:52:07.980
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: What's frustrating po is

asr-003251
01:52:07.980 --> 01:52:09.880
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: as simple as a document,

asr-003252
01:52:10.040 --> 01:52:11.140
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: as a bill of lading,

asr-003253
01:52:11.560 --> 01:52:12.480
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: as simple document,

asr-003254
01:52:12.560 --> 01:52:13.800
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: as certified through copy,

asr-003255
01:52:14.120 --> 01:52:15.960
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: will cause the dismissal of the case.

asr-003256
01:52:16.260 --> 01:52:18.220
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Forgive me, Secretary Vida,

asr-003257
01:52:19.360 --> 01:52:20.440
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Director Matiba,

asr-003258
01:52:20.480 --> 01:52:21.540
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: I'm challenging you.

asr-003259
01:52:21.680 --> 01:52:22.940
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: These people are untouchable

asr-003260
01:52:22.940 --> 01:52:24.460
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: up to this point.

asr-003261
01:52:26.220 --> 01:52:29.440
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: We're talking of billions of pesos worth

asr-003262
01:52:29.440 --> 01:52:31.980
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: of smuggled goods being brought into our country

asr-003263
01:52:31.980 --> 01:52:34.760
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: whose quality is questionable,

asr-003264
01:52:35.440 --> 01:52:37.580
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: whose safety standards are

asr-003265
01:52:37.580 --> 01:52:40.480
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: obviously unclear.

asr-003266
01:52:41.520 --> 01:52:43.760
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: These are untouchable people.

asr-003267
01:52:45.500 --> 01:52:46.520
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Prove to us,

asr-003268
01:52:47.060 --> 01:52:48.980
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: show us that they are not untouchable.

asr-003269
01:52:48.980 --> 01:52:50.260
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Pakita nyo sa amin.

asr-003270
01:52:50.480 --> 01:52:52.780
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Na itong mga bilyonaryong

asr-003271
01:52:52.780 --> 01:52:55.500
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: nagsasmuggle ng bilyong-bilyong halaga

asr-003272
01:52:55.500 --> 01:52:57.400
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: ng produktong agrikultura,

asr-003273
01:52:57.560 --> 01:52:58.460
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: kay baboy yan,

asr-003274
01:52:58.900 --> 01:52:59.840
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: kay gulay yan,

asr-003275
01:53:00.460 --> 01:53:01.260
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: manok.

asr-003276
01:53:02.520 --> 01:53:03.800
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Patunayan nyo sa amin.

asr-003277
01:53:05.580 --> 01:53:06.880
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Pakitanggilas po kayo

asr-003278
01:53:06.880 --> 01:53:09.600
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: na hindi sila untouchable.

asr-003279
01:53:09.700 --> 01:53:10.600
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Patunayan natin.

asr-003280
01:53:11.760 --> 01:53:13.620
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And I'm more than willing to

asr-003281
01:53:13.620 --> 01:53:16.320
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: support your budget

asr-003282
01:53:16.320 --> 01:53:20.320
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: as long as the bottom line is

asr-003283
01:53:20.320 --> 01:53:22.820
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: itong mga untouchable na mga smuggler

asr-003284
01:53:22.820 --> 01:53:24.180
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: tapos na dapat

asr-003285
01:53:24.180 --> 01:53:25.760
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: ang mga araw nila.

asr-003286
01:53:26.540 --> 01:53:28.080
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kawawa ang ating mga magsasaka,

asr-003287
01:53:28.660 --> 01:53:30.940
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: kawawa ang ating mga mangingisda,

asr-003288
01:53:31.460 --> 01:53:33.440
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: kawawa ang ating consumers

asr-003289
01:53:33.440 --> 01:53:34.800
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: na lahat

asr-003290
01:53:34.800 --> 01:53:36.000
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: ay

asr-003291
01:53:36.000 --> 01:53:39.620
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: nagdadaing dahil

asr-003292
01:53:39.620 --> 01:53:41.220
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: hindi na natin ma-afford

asr-003293
01:53:41.220 --> 01:53:42.500
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: yung murang pagkain,

asr-003294
01:53:42.960 --> 01:53:44.200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: dahil hindi na makatanim

asr-003295
01:53:44.200 --> 01:53:46.440
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: ng maayos ang ating mga magsasakat

asr-003296
01:53:46.440 --> 01:53:47.140
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: at mangingisda,

asr-003297
01:53:47.540 --> 01:53:49.940
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: dahil itong mga smuggled na mga produkto,

asr-003298
01:53:50.320 --> 01:53:51.340
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: kapapasok sa atin,

asr-003299
01:53:51.620 --> 01:53:52.800
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: nilalason tayo.

asr-003300
01:53:54.140 --> 01:53:56.040
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Winawasak ang ating food security.

asr-003301
01:53:58.400 --> 01:53:59.660
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Pasensya na dahil

asr-003302
01:53:59.660 --> 01:54:03.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: we cannot do this.

asr-003303
01:54:03.140 --> 01:54:04.560
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: The Senate alone cannot do this.

asr-003304
01:54:05.320 --> 01:54:06.220
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: We need your help

asr-003305
01:54:06.220 --> 01:54:07.020
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: and we need

asr-003306
01:54:07.020 --> 01:54:11.040
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: pakita naman natin na

asr-003307
01:54:11.040 --> 01:54:12.860
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: itong mga untouchable

asr-003308
01:54:12.860 --> 01:54:14.260
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: ay hindi totoo,

asr-003309
01:54:14.400 --> 01:54:16.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: bilang na mga araw nila.

asr-003310
01:54:16.860 --> 01:54:18.500
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: If I may respond,

asr-003311
01:54:18.500 --> 01:54:19.040
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes, please.

asr-003312
01:54:19.640 --> 01:54:20.300
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: The Department of Health,

asr-003313
01:54:20.320 --> 01:54:21.320
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: the Department of Justice

asr-003314
01:54:21.320 --> 01:54:22.780
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: under my leadership

asr-003315
01:54:22.780 --> 01:54:24.060
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: with all the 10 agencies

asr-003316
01:54:24.060 --> 01:54:26.320
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: is the primary law agency

asr-003317
01:54:26.320 --> 01:54:27.140
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: of the country.

asr-003318
01:54:27.940 --> 01:54:29.140
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Isa lang kung pinangawakan natin

asr-003319
01:54:29.140 --> 01:54:29.800
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: rule of law.

asr-003320
01:54:30.280 --> 01:54:31.740
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: No one should be above the law

asr-003321
01:54:31.740 --> 01:54:33.740
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: and we only prosecute

asr-003322
01:54:33.740 --> 01:54:35.480
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: those who need to be prosecuted

asr-003323
01:54:35.480 --> 01:54:36.740
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: and we will

asr-003324
01:54:36.740 --> 01:54:39.140
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: not prosecute those.

asr-003325
01:54:39.660 --> 01:54:40.440
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Batas lang po.

asr-003326
01:54:40.980 --> 01:54:42.300
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: And we've been doing this,

asr-003327
01:54:42.600 --> 01:54:43.320
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: sabi ng ibang komentator,

asr-003328
01:54:44.040 --> 01:54:45.160
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: may chilling effect daw.

asr-003329
01:54:45.540 --> 01:54:47.040
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: But I beg to disagree.

asr-003330
01:54:47.200 --> 01:54:48.420
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: It's not about chilling effect.

asr-003331
01:54:48.960 --> 01:54:50.300
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Ito na ho talaga yung advent

asr-003332
01:54:50.300 --> 01:54:52.100
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: ng rule of law sa Pilipinas.

asr-003333
01:54:52.680 --> 01:54:53.620
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Ito na po talaga

asr-003334
01:54:53.620 --> 01:54:54.740
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: ang dapat na norm

asr-003335
01:54:54.740 --> 01:54:58.140
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: kasi we owe it to the public,

asr-003336
01:54:58.280 --> 01:54:59.520
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: we owe it to the Filipinos,

asr-003337
01:54:59.660 --> 01:55:01.000
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: we owe it to the next generations,

asr-003338
01:55:01.140 --> 01:55:01.440
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Your Honor.

asr-003339
01:55:01.820 --> 01:55:03.200
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: And the Department of Justice

asr-003340
01:55:03.200 --> 01:55:04.140
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: will be with you,

asr-003341
01:55:04.220 --> 01:55:04.760
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: with the Senate,

asr-003342
01:55:05.400 --> 01:55:05.960
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: in this.

asr-003343
01:55:06.520 --> 01:55:07.980
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Sana ito na po yung norm.

asr-003344
01:55:08.500 --> 01:55:09.360
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Ito na po talaga.

asr-003345
01:55:09.980 --> 01:55:11.320
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Walang, walang yung,

asr-003346
01:55:11.520 --> 01:55:12.760
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: hindi titingnan yung pangalan,

asr-003347
01:55:12.960 --> 01:55:14.080
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: hindi titingnan yung malaki,

asr-003348
01:55:14.200 --> 01:55:14.720
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: maliit.

asr-003349
01:55:15.680 --> 01:55:17.180
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Sundin lang natin yung batas.

asr-003350
01:55:17.720 --> 01:55:19.160
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: At yung po ang aming direksyon,

asr-003351
01:55:19.160 --> 01:55:19.760
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: mahal na,

asr-003352
01:55:19.760 --> 01:55:20.260
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Senator.

asr-003353
01:55:20.640 --> 01:55:21.320
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Maraming salamat.

asr-003354
01:55:21.380 --> 01:55:21.800
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And just,

asr-003355
01:55:22.080 --> 01:55:22.580
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: very quickly,

asr-003356
01:55:22.720 --> 01:55:23.520
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: you have my commitment.

asr-003357
01:55:23.740 --> 01:55:25.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: If we have to meet every day,

asr-003358
01:55:25.520 --> 01:55:27.460
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: hanggang itong mga untouchable na ito,

asr-003359
01:55:27.820 --> 01:55:27.840
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: ay,

asr-003360
01:55:28.120 --> 01:55:28.760
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: ay,

asr-003361
01:55:28.860 --> 01:55:30.480
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: masampola na.

asr-003362
01:55:31.500 --> 01:55:32.100
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: You know,

asr-003363
01:55:32.140 --> 01:55:32.560
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: when we were,

asr-003364
01:55:32.760 --> 01:55:33.700
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: and this is my last point,

asr-003365
01:55:33.920 --> 01:55:35.160
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: when we went after them,

asr-003366
01:55:35.260 --> 01:55:36.240
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: hammer and tongs,

asr-003367
01:55:37.280 --> 01:55:38.260
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: in 2014,

asr-003368
01:55:38.460 --> 01:55:39.040
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: 2015,

asr-003369
