DOJ Undersecretary Deo Marco: Good morning, Your Honors.

asr-003570
02:02:53.160 --> 02:02:55.440
DOJ Undersecretary Deo Marco: At first, we were looking at two ways to do it.

asr-003571
02:02:55.600 --> 02:02:57.100
DOJ Undersecretary Deo Marco: First one would be through legislation.

asr-003572
02:02:57.340 --> 02:03:02.420
DOJ Undersecretary Deo Marco: But during the study, we figured out that this was done before through an executive order.

asr-003573
02:03:02.960 --> 02:03:09.700
DOJ Undersecretary Deo Marco: The only law that could probably be maybe a problem for this would be the local government code.

asr-003574
02:03:10.420 --> 02:03:16.600
DOJ Undersecretary Deo Marco: Because the provincial jails, according to the local government code, belongs to the provincial.

asr-003575
02:03:17.080 --> 02:03:19.360
DOJ Undersecretary Deo Marco: That's the only problem, Your Honors.

asr-003576
02:03:21.160 --> 02:03:21.500
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yeah.

asr-003577
02:03:22.060 --> 02:03:23.320
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Binigyan ng staff ko, no?

asr-003578
02:03:23.560 --> 02:03:26.360
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Also under the Government Optimization Act.

asr-003579
02:03:26.360 --> 02:03:26.680
Senator Panfilo Lacson: No?

asr-003580
02:03:27.340 --> 02:03:29.080
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Pwede rin mag-reorganize yung Pangulo.

asr-003581
02:03:29.980 --> 02:03:32.980
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So maraming available na pieces of legislation.

asr-003582
02:03:33.080 --> 02:03:35.060
Senator Panfilo Lacson: No longer legislation, but batas.

asr-003583
02:03:35.280 --> 02:03:35.820
DOJ Undersecretary Deo Marco: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-003584
02:03:35.980 --> 02:03:39.900
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So maybe you can work around itong dinidiscuss natin.

asr-003585
02:03:40.020 --> 02:03:40.440
DOJ Undersecretary Deo Marco: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-003586
02:03:40.540 --> 02:03:46.200
DOJ Undersecretary Deo Marco: The present status right now is we have already formed a technical working group with the DILG, with the BJMP.

asr-003587
02:03:46.720 --> 02:03:50.000
DOJ Undersecretary Deo Marco: And by the end of this month, we should be done with the draft EO already.

asr-003588
02:03:50.620 --> 02:03:51.020
DOJ Undersecretary Deo Marco: Thank you.

asr-003589
02:03:51.020 --> 02:03:54.280
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: What is the exact provision in the local government code?

asr-003590
02:03:55.080 --> 02:03:55.920
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Would you have it?

asr-003591
02:03:56.260 --> 02:03:57.260
DOJ Undersecretary Deo Marco: I'll look it up.

asr-003592
02:03:57.340 --> 02:04:02.340
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: As you, before, we can proceed with the other items, but later on, we'll go back to you.

asr-003593
02:04:02.340 --> 02:04:03.280
DOJ Undersecretary Deo Marco: Thank you, Your Honors.

asr-003594
02:04:04.120 --> 02:04:04.680
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Wala na akong.

asr-003595
02:04:04.760 --> 02:04:06.220
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Alas dosi na, Mr. Chairman.

asr-003596
02:04:06.420 --> 02:04:07.320
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Pauwi na natin sila.

asr-003597
02:04:08.740 --> 02:04:10.440
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Meron lang akong ilang katanungan.

asr-003598
02:04:10.900 --> 02:04:14.580
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: For the record lang, Senator Ping, we were able to collate.

asr-003599
02:04:16.000 --> 02:04:24.020
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: The department was able to remit to the Bureau of Treasury 18,715,924,000.

asr-003600
02:04:24.020 --> 02:04:27.020
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: But what was released under...

asr-003601
02:04:27.340 --> 02:04:36.340
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Their special account to the DOJ family is the total only of P262,778,000.

asr-003602
02:04:36.820 --> 02:04:37.820
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: That's based on that.

asr-003603
02:04:38.140 --> 02:04:40.080
Senator Panfilo Lacson: We'll take note of that, Secretary Vida.

asr-003604
02:04:42.720 --> 02:04:44.600
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ano lang na remit out of 18?

asr-003605
02:04:45.360 --> 02:04:45.840
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Maliit.

asr-003606
02:04:46.260 --> 02:04:46.680
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Yes, sir.

asr-003607
02:04:47.240 --> 02:04:49.000
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Sir, pahabol ko lang po. Pasensya na po.

asr-003608
02:04:49.380 --> 02:04:50.200
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Go ahead, Director.

asr-003609
02:04:50.220 --> 02:04:54.060
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Meron po rin kaming request saan ng restatement doon sa proposal namin.

asr-003610
02:04:54.340 --> 02:04:57.060
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: This will help yung aming mga...

asr-003611
02:04:57.340 --> 02:04:58.680
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: mga agents po.

asr-003612
02:04:59.020 --> 02:05:02.860
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: I'm requesting for a budget for the increase of their hazard pay.

asr-003613
02:05:03.380 --> 02:05:07.200
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Ngayon po kasi they're just getting P4,000 a month na hazard pay

asr-003614
02:05:07.200 --> 02:05:09.900
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: which is no longer at par with other law enforcement group.

asr-003615
02:05:10.460 --> 02:05:11.880
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Baka po pwedeng gawin P15,000.

asr-003616
02:05:12.020 --> 02:05:16.020
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: This will increase po about P97 million a year po na madagdag.

asr-003617
02:05:16.120 --> 02:05:18.980
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Which will boost the morale of our law enforcement po,

asr-003618
02:05:19.020 --> 02:05:20.060
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: ng mga agents po natin.

asr-003619
02:05:20.200 --> 02:05:20.700
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Salamat po.

asr-003620
02:05:22.380 --> 02:05:25.020
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Wala sa NBI modernization law yan?

asr-003621
02:05:25.940 --> 02:05:26.640
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Tinatanong na, Senator Ping.

asr-003622
02:05:26.640 --> 02:05:27.180
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Actually, nakalagay po.

asr-003623
02:05:27.180 --> 02:05:31.340
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Nakalagay po na wala pong nakalagay na provisions na gano'n.

asr-003624
02:05:31.440 --> 02:05:37.320
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Pero we are actually requesting for that para lang po sana yung ikot po ng tao.

asr-003625
02:05:37.320 --> 02:05:41.220
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: We only have about 370 agents po sa buong Pilipinas po.

asr-003626
02:05:41.880 --> 02:05:42.680
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Ganun lang po karami.

asr-003627
02:05:42.780 --> 02:05:47.180
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Pero nagsulat na po kami sa DBM to increase the number of our agents.

asr-003628
02:05:47.920 --> 02:05:50.040
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Kasi under the modernization,

asr-003629
02:05:50.760 --> 02:05:54.740
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: ang minimum po na requirement na agents namin per region at per district.

asr-003630
02:05:54.740 --> 02:05:57.140
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: When you say district, yung province po, the 82 provinces.

asr-003631
02:05:57.180 --> 02:06:01.180
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Now, 6 dapat per region at per district.

asr-003632
02:06:02.040 --> 02:06:04.140
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Ganyan po, we only have 370 po.

asr-003633
02:06:04.140 --> 02:06:06.300
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Director Melvin, kindly check again.

asr-003634
02:06:06.560 --> 02:06:10.600
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kasi baka may naliligaw na provision para budget na lang yung problema.

asr-003635
02:06:11.880 --> 02:06:16.000
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Baka mayroong provision doon na related na pwedeng lagyan ng budget.

asr-003636
02:06:16.960 --> 02:06:19.560
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Pakireview na lang ulit yung NBI modernization.

asr-003637
02:06:20.400 --> 02:06:21.880
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kasi kapapasa lang yan.

asr-003638
02:06:22.720 --> 02:06:25.400
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Baka naman mayroong naliligaw doon na nabanggit yung hazard.

asr-003639
02:06:25.840 --> 02:06:26.520
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Sige po.

asr-003640
02:06:27.180 --> 02:06:28.320
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Nagsulat na lang po namin sa inyo po.

asr-003641
02:06:28.460 --> 02:06:29.460
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Maraming salamat po.

asr-003642
02:06:29.960 --> 02:06:31.620
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Address it to the chairman of the committee.

asr-003643
02:06:31.900 --> 02:06:32.860
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ito pala meron oh.

asr-003644
02:06:32.920 --> 02:06:33.340
Senator Panfilo Lacson: There you go.

asr-003645
02:06:34.340 --> 02:06:34.900
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Go ahead sir.

asr-003646
02:06:35.040 --> 02:06:36.260
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Section 10.

asr-003647
02:06:38.000 --> 02:06:39.200
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Benefits and privileges.

asr-003648
02:06:40.920 --> 02:06:41.720
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Paragraph E.

asr-003649
02:06:41.940 --> 02:06:42.500
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Hazard pay.

asr-003650
02:06:43.880 --> 02:06:45.800
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Subject to pertinent laws and rules.

asr-003651
02:06:45.940 --> 02:06:50.000
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Meaning, pag sinabing subject to pertinent laws, gaayon.

asr-003652
02:06:50.740 --> 02:06:50.960
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Di ba?

asr-003653
02:06:51.420 --> 02:06:52.640
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So hindi na kailangan ng legislation.

asr-003654
02:06:53.300 --> 02:06:54.260
Senator Panfilo Lacson: It's already there.

asr-003655
02:06:56.240 --> 02:06:57.040
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Yes sir.

asr-003656
02:06:57.180 --> 02:06:58.980
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: That's why we're requesting po for the...

asr-003657
02:06:58.980 --> 02:07:00.980
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kaya, mag-usap pala kayo ng chairman.

asr-003658
02:07:01.100 --> 02:07:01.280
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: Opo.

asr-003659
02:07:01.900 --> 02:07:05.200
NBI Director Melvin Matibag: 97 million po yung computation namin for everyone po.

asr-003660
02:07:05.480 --> 02:07:08.680
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Please address it to the chairman of the committee just through me.

asr-003661
02:07:09.060 --> 02:07:11.300
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Chairman through the vice chairman.

asr-003662
02:07:11.680 --> 02:07:12.040
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Thank you.

asr-003663
02:07:12.500 --> 02:07:13.080
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Go ahead sir.

asr-003664
02:07:14.420 --> 02:07:17.820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siguro, just a few more points sa Mr. Chair.

asr-003665
02:07:18.620 --> 02:07:21.920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siguro, dahil ka-ask to us, Commissioner Joel.

asr-003666
02:07:23.380 --> 02:07:24.840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Viado sa BI.

asr-003667
02:07:24.840 --> 02:07:24.920
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay.

asr-003668
02:07:25.020 --> 02:07:25.840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung pong...

asr-003669
02:07:27.180 --> 02:07:29.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: e-gates and Border Management System.

asr-003670
02:07:29.420 --> 02:07:30.380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasi budget eh.

asr-003671
02:07:30.500 --> 02:07:31.320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya I have to ask.

asr-003672
02:07:32.100 --> 02:07:32.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: As early as

asr-003673
02:07:32.720 --> 02:07:38.280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 2017, Bureau of Immigration has been receiving allocation for its Border Management Information System.

asr-003674
02:07:39.140 --> 02:07:45.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: From 2017 to 2026, the project has received a total allocation of almost 10 billion. For 2027,

asr-003675
02:07:46.600 --> 02:07:51.820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Allocation of BMIS is just 524 million.

asr-003676
02:07:51.820 --> 02:07:54.740
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero through the years, malaki na rin ito.

asr-003677
02:07:54.740 --> 02:07:58.140
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 2024, 2.6 billion.

asr-003678
02:07:58.320 --> 02:08:00.560
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 2025, 3.8 billion.

asr-003679
02:08:01.400 --> 02:08:03.240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 2026, 1.8 billion.

asr-003680
02:08:04.460 --> 02:08:08.000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Just like to ask, medyo malaki kasi ito.

asr-003681
02:08:08.060 --> 02:08:16.160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But what are the components so that everybody will understand of this project aside from the expansion of the e-gates in our international ports?

asr-003682
02:08:16.460 --> 02:08:16.880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ano po ito?

asr-003683
02:08:16.940 --> 02:08:17.900
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: For convenience lang?

asr-003684
02:08:17.980 --> 02:08:23.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Or does it include the software, lahat po ng information system?

asr-003685
02:08:23.080 --> 02:08:24.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So probably can...

asr-003686
02:08:24.740 --> 02:08:27.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: You can expound, Commissioner Joel.

asr-003687
02:08:27.940 --> 02:08:28.160
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes.

asr-003688
02:08:28.320 --> 02:08:31.240
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Thank you very much po, Senator Ejercito.

asr-003689
02:08:31.480 --> 02:08:33.580
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: With the permission of our Honorable Secretary.

asr-003690
02:08:33.580 --> 02:08:44.580
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang components po ng e-gates project po namin, which aims to not only strengthen border control but also modernize the primary immigration processing,

asr-003691
02:08:46.000 --> 02:08:52.580
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: accelerate clearances, prevent fraud, and streamline the immigration processing through biometric verification.

asr-003692
02:08:53.520 --> 02:08:54.580
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang components po niyan are the following.

asr-003693
02:08:54.740 --> 02:08:59.540
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: First, biometrics capture device in manned inspection counters.

asr-003694
02:09:00.280 --> 02:09:16.040
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang description po nito, it is a self-contained device at manned counters, which will capture the traveler's biometric data, such as fingerprints and facial images, with seamless software integration for operation.

asr-003695
02:09:17.040 --> 02:09:19.980
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Number two po, yung hardware po ng e-gates.

asr-003696
02:09:20.080 --> 02:09:21.500
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yan po yung nakikita po natin.

asr-003697
02:09:21.500 --> 02:09:24.500
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: These are automated self-service gates.

asr-003698
02:09:24.740 --> 02:09:31.080
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: These are the gates that allow eligible travelers to clear immigration without going through a manned counter.

asr-003699
02:09:31.800 --> 02:09:45.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ito pong e-gates, they read the traveler's passport, they capture live biometrics, they verify the person's identity against the passport, they check the regulatory records, and open the gates if all checks are passed.

asr-003700
02:09:46.360 --> 02:09:52.000
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Kasama rin po dito ang automated biometric identification system, o yung tinatawag po nating ABIS.

asr-003701
02:09:52.000 --> 02:09:54.000
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: It's the central system that stores...

asr-003702
02:09:54.740 --> 02:10:01.060
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: It's the central system that stores and matches face and fingerprint data for real-time identity verification and fraud detection.

asr-003703
02:10:02.200 --> 02:10:04.620
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Meron din pong e-gates monitoring station.

asr-003704
02:10:05.220 --> 02:10:13.020
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ito po ang workstations used by immigration officers to monitor the status and performance of all e-gates in real-time.

asr-003705
02:10:13.800 --> 02:10:22.040
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: The system shows whether each gate is operational, in use, or requires assistance, allowing officers to respond quickly to any issues.

asr-003706
02:10:22.300 --> 02:10:24.620
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Andyan din po ang border control data.

asr-003708
02:10:24.720 --> 02:10:27.620
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: exchange platform, or BCDEP.

asr-003709
02:10:28.480 --> 02:10:35.740
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: The secure platform that enables safe, real-time data sharing among border control systems and agencies.

asr-003710
02:10:36.480 --> 02:10:38.740
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Andyan din po ang administrative back-end system.

asr-003711
02:10:39.420 --> 02:10:45.580
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: The management system for monitoring usage, performance, and configuration of e-gates and related components.

asr-003712
02:10:46.180 --> 02:10:48.760
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Meron din pong document verification software.

asr-003713
02:10:48.760 --> 02:10:53.760
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: It displays all verification results performed on the passport within the immigration...

asr-003714
02:10:54.720 --> 02:10:56.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ...officer's interface.

asr-003715
02:10:57.440 --> 02:11:00.740
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Nakaka-indicate po siya ng any detected anomalies or inconsistencies.

asr-003716
02:11:01.200 --> 02:11:03.100
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Meron din pong network requirements.

asr-003717
02:11:03.920 --> 02:11:07.240
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Kailangan po kasi yung communications infrastructure maigi.

asr-003718
02:11:07.880 --> 02:11:14.180
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Nandun po yung switchers, routers, cabling, tsaka yung Wi-Fi that can securely connect all e-gate components.

asr-003719
02:11:14.840 --> 02:11:17.940
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Meron din pong server requirements na kailangan pong kasusan.

asr-003720
02:11:18.480 --> 02:11:23.940
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: The servers host and run core e-gate systems to handle transactions reliably...

asr-003721
02:11:24.720 --> 02:11:26.380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ...and support future growth.

asr-003722
02:11:27.140 --> 02:11:28.840
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Bangsan po po ang system integration.

asr-003723
02:11:29.180 --> 02:11:35.300
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: It will connect all e-gates and biometric systems with the border control information system...

asr-003724
02:11:35.300 --> 02:11:39.500
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ...and other databases for real-time checks and smooth passenger flow.

asr-003725
02:11:40.180 --> 02:11:43.160
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Meron din pong backup and disaster recovery.

asr-003726
02:11:43.320 --> 02:11:46.020
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yan po yung kung mag-down yung system, dapat po may backup.

asr-003727
02:11:46.760 --> 02:11:54.480
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: The data backups and redundant systems aim to protect information and restore operations quickly.

asr-003728
02:11:54.720 --> 02:11:56.760
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: After failures or disruptions.

asr-003729
02:11:57.520 --> 02:12:02.000
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Meron din pong kailangan kasusan na support, maintenance, and warranty.

asr-003730
02:12:02.900 --> 02:12:11.280
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: For ongoing technical support, preventive maintenance, and repairs to keep all e-gates components running reliably.

asr-003731
02:12:11.940 --> 02:12:18.140
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: And last but not the least, anyan po yung training or structured training for the officers and staff...

asr-003732
02:12:18.140 --> 02:12:22.820
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ...on operating, monitoring, and maintaining the e-gates and associated systems.

asr-003733
02:12:23.220 --> 02:12:24.000
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So we have to consider...

asr-003734
02:12:24.720 --> 02:12:31.180
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ...your honors, na hindi lang po yung hardware ang kailangan pong paglaanan ng budget.

asr-003735
02:12:31.180 --> 02:12:37.180
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Andiyan po ang isang system na kailangan tumakbo not only in the airports in Metro Manila...

asr-003736
02:12:37.740 --> 02:12:41.080
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ...but interconnected with all the other airports in the whole Philippines.

asr-003737
02:12:41.640 --> 02:12:41.900
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yan po.

asr-003738
02:12:42.400 --> 02:12:48.640
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Chair Chairman, ang facial identification or facial recognition, yung requirement ninyo?

asr-003739
02:12:48.860 --> 02:12:50.080
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Facial recognition, yung requirement.

asr-003740
02:12:50.080 --> 02:12:51.040
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Recognition, mahal yan.

asr-003741
02:12:52.280 --> 02:12:54.560
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: We have been working, your honor...

asr-003742
02:12:54.560 --> 02:12:54.700
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ...with the...

asr-003743
02:12:54.720 --> 02:12:59.780
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ...within the budget, kung ano po ang naibigay sa amin pong budget po ng ating pong kapulungan.

asr-003744
02:13:00.320 --> 02:13:02.000
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yun po, we're working within that po.

asr-003745
02:13:02.600 --> 02:13:12.180
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So ang stages po niyan, ang first phase po, 1.9 billion, but we were able to lower that to 1.5 billion po.

asr-003746
02:13:12.700 --> 02:13:23.740
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: And secondly po, Your Honor, yung phase 2 po ng proyekto namin is around [unclear].

asr-003747
02:13:23.740 --> 02:13:29.340
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: 1 billion 347 million 57 thousand.

asr-003748
02:13:29.340 --> 02:13:32.120
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Hindi ko kasanayin na magbasa ng napakaraming...

asr-003749
02:13:32.120 --> 02:13:33.800
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Lagi mo inisip yung milyon.

asr-003750
02:13:33.820 --> 02:13:35.700
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Lagi, laging, laging, ano po.

asr-003751
02:13:36.060 --> 02:13:45.040
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: And phase 3 po ng proyekto is for 2026, 536,072,000, your honors.

asr-003752
02:13:45.420 --> 02:13:45.700
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yan po.

asr-003753
02:13:46.140 --> 02:13:50.220
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kasi basically, di ba, pagka facial identification, ang tanong lang, sino to?

asr-003754
02:13:51.300 --> 02:13:53.700
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Pero pagka facial recognition, may matching.

asr-003755
02:13:53.700 --> 02:13:54.360
Senator Panfilo Lacson: May matching pa ito, di ba?

asr-003756
02:13:54.520 --> 02:13:55.400
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, po, your honor.

asr-003757
02:13:55.680 --> 02:13:59.160
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Kaya po, meron po kaming biometric capturing systems po na binili.

asr-003758
02:13:59.300 --> 02:14:04.960
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Not only the hardware, but meron pong biometric capturing devices po na binili, your honor.

asr-003759
02:14:05.080 --> 02:14:05.960
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Kasi yan po ang crucial.

asr-003760
02:14:07.000 --> 02:14:14.600
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Meron pa nga pong instances, your honor, na meron pong airports na maaring hindi kailangan ng e-gates because of the passenger traffic,

asr-003761
02:14:15.120 --> 02:14:17.680
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: pero kailangan ng biometric identification system.

asr-003762
02:14:18.040 --> 02:14:18.460
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yan po.

asr-003763
02:14:19.180 --> 02:14:23.340
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Sa Southeast Asia, tayo na lang ba yung walang facial recognition?

asr-003764
02:14:24.520 --> 02:14:31.660
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Hindi ko po masabi sa buong Southeast Asia, your honor, but I've been to different airports all over Southeast Asia and Asia.

asr-003765
02:14:32.440 --> 02:14:42.160
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Nakita ko na po yan sa, of course, Singapore, ang Indonesia, sa Bali, ang dami po nilang mga e-gates, ang Japan, of course, and Korea.

asr-003766
02:14:42.420 --> 02:14:45.160
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yan po. Marami po talagang mga bansa, your honors, na gumagamit.

asr-003767
02:14:45.260 --> 02:14:49.340
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Kindly walk us through, no? Pagka meron na tayong facial recognition technology.

asr-003768
02:14:50.220 --> 02:14:50.780
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, your honor.

asr-003769
02:14:52.780 --> 02:14:53.260
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Anong...

asr-003770
02:14:53.260 --> 02:14:54.420
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Anong mako-cover nito?

asr-003771
02:14:54.780 --> 02:14:58.340
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Pagdating ng pasahero, wala na tayo yung mga boots.

asr-003772
02:14:58.880 --> 02:14:59.580
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, your honor.

asr-003773
02:14:59.580 --> 02:15:00.000
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, your honor.

asr-003774
02:15:00.000 --> 02:15:00.880
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-003775
02:15:00.880 --> 02:15:01.260
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Hanggang Pochina.

asr-003776
02:15:01.900 --> 02:15:02.420
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-003777
02:15:02.500 --> 02:15:04.500
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: That is the ultimate objective, Your Honor.

asr-003778
02:15:04.660 --> 02:15:06.400
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Gaya po ng sa ibang bansa, Your Honor.

asr-003779
02:15:06.520 --> 02:15:08.080
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Nadadaan na lang po kayo sa Amerika po.

asr-003780
02:15:08.180 --> 02:15:08.360
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ganun.

asr-003781
02:15:08.640 --> 02:15:10.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Pagdaan, nakaka-capture na po lahat.

asr-003782
02:15:10.340 --> 02:15:11.200
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Lahat captured na.

asr-003783
02:15:11.340 --> 02:15:14.560
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So, you don't need to queue.

asr-003784
02:15:14.720 --> 02:15:14.800
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Di ba?

asr-003785
02:15:14.880 --> 02:15:15.900
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Hindi ka na magka-queue.

asr-003786
02:15:15.980 --> 02:15:16.900
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-003787
02:15:17.080 --> 02:15:17.540
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ganun po.

asr-003788
02:15:17.700 --> 02:15:20.820
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Because to which is own, you just go through.

asr-003789
02:15:21.560 --> 02:15:22.520
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes po, Your Honor.

asr-003790
02:15:22.920 --> 02:15:25.460
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang maganda po kasi sa ganitong approach, Your Honor,

asr-003791
02:15:26.140 --> 02:15:27.760
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: yung manual counters po,

asr-003792
02:15:27.760 --> 02:15:30.940
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: kung hindi mababawasan, matatanggal totally.

asr-003793
02:15:31.300 --> 02:15:34.020
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: But we are adopting a step-ladder approach.

asr-003794
02:15:34.360 --> 02:15:35.760
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Kasi po, we have to admit,

asr-003795
02:15:36.220 --> 02:15:37.960
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: kumbaga ho sa levels,

asr-003796
02:15:38.440 --> 02:15:40.180
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: kumbaga ho nandito pa ho tayo sa level 1.

asr-003797
02:15:40.300 --> 02:15:43.780
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Hindi naman ho pwedeng agad-agad na sa level number 10 po tayo.

asr-003798
02:15:44.060 --> 02:15:46.840
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So, we have to go through the different processes and phases.

asr-003799
02:15:47.400 --> 02:15:51.200
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: At ito po ang naisip namin na unang hakbang po,

asr-003800
02:15:51.460 --> 02:15:53.740
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: patungo po doon sa ating adhikain,

asr-003801
02:15:53.740 --> 02:15:57.740
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: na lahat e dumaan doon sa tinatawag po nating artificial intelligence.

asr-003802
02:15:57.820 --> 02:15:58.160
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-003803
02:15:58.360 --> 02:15:59.140
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ito po ang...

asr-003804
02:15:59.140 --> 02:16:00.620
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Wala nang human intervention.

asr-003805
02:16:00.840 --> 02:16:01.460
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-003806
02:16:01.580 --> 02:16:02.380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: That would...

asr-003807
02:16:02.380 --> 02:16:04.800
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ang problema nyo, saan nyo itatapon yung mga employees ninyo?

asr-003808
02:16:05.040 --> 02:16:07.860
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Your Honor, we have to consider yun po,

asr-003809
02:16:08.020 --> 02:16:12.700
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: na we are expecting passenger traffic to really increase exponentially.

asr-003810
02:16:13.200 --> 02:16:15.780
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So, we still need the immigration personnel.

asr-003811
02:16:16.140 --> 02:16:19.700
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: We also need people to man the different e-gates

asr-003812
02:16:19.700 --> 02:16:21.100
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: and the different systems.

asr-003813
02:16:21.460 --> 02:16:25.840
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ultimately po, maari pong ma-prevent siya from entering,

asr-003814
02:16:26.340 --> 02:16:27.100
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: but...

asr-003815
02:16:27.760 --> 02:16:30.020
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: The discretion of the immigration officers still remains.

asr-003816
02:16:30.120 --> 02:16:30.880
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So, kailangan pa rin po namin.

asr-003817
02:16:30.880 --> 02:16:32.820
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So, how much do we need for the first phase?

asr-003818
02:16:33.520 --> 02:16:35.820
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: 1.3 billion.

asr-003819
02:16:36.160 --> 02:16:37.820
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Na ibigay na po sa amin, Your Honor.

asr-003820
02:16:37.860 --> 02:16:38.480
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Ah, nandiyan na.

asr-003821
02:16:38.640 --> 02:16:40.400
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So, in the works na ito?

asr-003822
02:16:40.600 --> 02:16:41.540
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes po, Your Honor.

asr-003823
02:16:42.280 --> 02:16:43.600
Senator Panfilo Lacson: So, where are we now?

asr-003824
02:16:44.820 --> 02:16:45.600
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Sa ano po?

asr-003825
02:16:46.380 --> 02:16:49.040
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Sa phase 2 na po tayo, Your Honor.

asr-003826
02:16:49.660 --> 02:16:50.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Nasa phase 2 na po.

asr-003827
02:16:50.220 --> 02:16:50.840
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Nasa NEP yan?

asr-003828
02:16:51.820 --> 02:16:52.800
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes po, Your Honor.

asr-003829
02:16:54.280 --> 02:16:56.620
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Sufficient or not enough?

asr-003830
02:16:56.620 --> 02:16:58.220
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Yung nasa NEP?

asr-003831
02:17:01.500 --> 02:17:02.160
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Sapat na ba?

asr-003832
02:17:02.260 --> 02:17:04.120
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Enough na po, Your Honor.

asr-003833
02:17:04.480 --> 02:17:05.800
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: If I may, Your Honor.

asr-003834
02:17:05.800 --> 02:17:06.880
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Wala na po nga, pigi-usapang budget.

asr-003835
02:17:08.560 --> 02:17:09.160
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Okay na po.

asr-003836
02:17:09.720 --> 02:17:10.360
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Your Honor.

asr-003837
02:17:10.500 --> 02:17:11.200
Senator Panfilo Lacson: I-adapt na lang yung NEP, ano?

asr-003838
02:17:11.800 --> 02:17:12.140
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes po.

asr-003839
02:17:12.300 --> 02:17:13.440
Senator Panfilo Lacson: I-adapt na lang yung NEP.

asr-003840
02:17:13.640 --> 02:17:13.900
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes po.

asr-003841
02:17:13.900 --> 02:17:14.300
Senator Panfilo Lacson: Okay na kayo?

asr-003842
02:17:14.600 --> 02:17:14.800
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Apo.

asr-003843
02:17:15.000 --> 02:17:18.020
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: If I may give the specific phases po, kung nasa na po.

asr-003844
02:17:18.680 --> 02:17:20.180
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang status po ng phase 1,

asr-003845
02:17:20.660 --> 02:17:23.080
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: the procurement of the e-gates project has been completed

asr-003846
02:17:23.080 --> 02:17:26.080
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: with a notice to proceed issued on 12 March 2026.

asr-003847
02:17:26.620 --> 02:17:28.920
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: to the winning joint venture and bidder.

asr-003848
02:17:29.300 --> 02:17:31.420
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: The project implementation will be undertaken

asr-003849
02:17:31.420 --> 02:17:34.100
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: over a 9-month period from receipt of the NTP.

asr-003850
02:17:34.320 --> 02:17:37.000
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So from March 12, may 9-month period po.

asr-003851
02:17:37.180 --> 02:17:38.360
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang phase 2 po, Your Honors.

asr-003852
02:17:39.000 --> 02:17:40.800
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: The technical specifications were submitted

asr-003853
02:17:40.800 --> 02:17:42.500
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: to the Office of the Department of Justice,

asr-003854
02:17:43.120 --> 02:17:44.880
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Chief Information Technology Officer,

asr-003855
02:17:45.100 --> 02:17:46.860
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: on September 8, 2026.

asr-003856
02:17:47.440 --> 02:17:49.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: And it was approved on the same day.

asr-003857
02:17:49.780 --> 02:17:52.080
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Subsequently, the invitation to bid was posted

asr-003858
02:17:52.080 --> 02:17:54.080
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: on September 19, 2026,

asr-003859
02:17:54.480 --> 02:17:56.560
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: with a pre-bid conference set for

asr-003860
02:17:56.560 --> 02:17:58.820
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: September 30, 2026, Your Honor.

asr-003861
02:17:59.160 --> 02:18:00.960
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang phase 3 po ng proyekto,

asr-003862
02:18:01.860 --> 02:18:04.780
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: a letter directive constituting the e-gates phase 3

asr-003863
02:18:04.780 --> 02:18:07.360
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: project management team, or PMT,

asr-003864
02:18:07.440 --> 02:18:09.120
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: has been issued by the Office of the Commissioner

asr-003865
02:18:09.120 --> 02:18:10.160
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: of the Bureau of Immigration,

asr-003866
02:18:10.560 --> 02:18:12.880
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: and the drafting of the technical specifications

asr-003867
02:18:12.880 --> 02:18:15.780
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: will commence shortly thereafter, Your Honor.

asr-003868
02:18:16.000 --> 02:18:19.380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: We have also done the required market scoping

asr-003869
02:18:19.380 --> 02:18:24.680
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: as required by BI Memorandum No. 2025-132

asr-003870
02:18:24.680 --> 02:18:26.380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: in line with the new government's

asr-003871
02:18:26.560 --> 02:18:27.700
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Procurement Act.

asr-003872
02:18:28.060 --> 02:18:30.320
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So dinaanam po namin yung pag-scope po

asr-003873
02:18:30.320 --> 02:18:33.280
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: sa merkado as a preliminary step

asr-003874
02:18:33.280 --> 02:18:35.800
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: in strategic procurement planning, Your Honor.

asr-003875
02:18:37.800 --> 02:18:39.960
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Just to continue, by the way,

asr-003876
02:18:40.120 --> 02:18:41.160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Mr. Chair, bago nat,

asr-003877
02:18:42.160 --> 02:18:43.340
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: si Yusek March pala.

asr-003878
02:18:43.480 --> 02:18:44.160
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Batiin natin.

asr-003879
02:18:45.260 --> 02:18:46.980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Congratulations sa bagong kasal.

asr-003880
02:18:48.960 --> 02:18:50.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Anyway, commercial, huh?

asr-003881
02:18:51.060 --> 02:18:53.920
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: How are you related, Yusek Gutierrez?

asr-003882
02:18:53.920 --> 02:18:54.200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Thank you.

asr-003883
02:18:54.200 --> 02:18:59.640
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Ah, Yusek Gutierrez, you're the daughter

asr-003884
02:18:59.640 --> 02:19:02.240
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: of former Secretary Gutierrez.

asr-003885
02:19:02.920 --> 02:19:03.200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay.

asr-003886
02:19:03.660 --> 02:19:06.280
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: We were together in the JBC.

asr-003887
02:19:06.680 --> 02:19:07.280
DOJ Undersecretary Margarita N. Gutierrez: Okay, sir.

asr-003888
02:19:07.340 --> 02:19:08.460
DOJ Undersecretary Margarita N. Gutierrez: And it's her birthday today.

asr-003889
02:19:08.800 --> 02:19:09.680
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: It's her birthday today.

asr-003890
02:19:09.820 --> 02:19:11.000
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Please tell her happy birthday.

asr-003891
02:19:11.340 --> 02:19:13.380
DOJ Undersecretary Margarita N. Gutierrez: And I'm putting that also on record.

asr-003892
02:19:14.200 --> 02:19:17.120
DOJ Undersecretary Garney M. Candelaria: Sir, if I may, on record, sir,

asr-003893
02:19:17.800 --> 02:19:19.600
DOJ Undersecretary Garney M. Candelaria: Usec Margarita Llamanzares.

asr-003894
02:19:20.400 --> 02:19:21.660
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Oh, yes, that's right.

asr-003895
02:19:21.660 --> 02:19:24.160
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Thank you.

asr-003896
02:19:24.200 --> 02:19:24.940
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes, that's correct.

asr-003897
02:19:25.060 --> 02:19:26.620
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Congratulations and best wishes.

asr-003898
02:19:26.880 --> 02:19:27.320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, sir.

asr-003899
02:19:27.320 --> 02:19:28.120
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-003900
02:19:29.120 --> 02:19:31.280
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, ang component pa ito, kaya mahal,

asr-003901
02:19:31.400 --> 02:19:33.300
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: it's not just for convenience

asr-003902
02:19:33.300 --> 02:19:34.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: na akala kasi natin.

asr-003903
02:19:34.720 --> 02:19:36.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Parang yung laman lang ng passport,

asr-003904
02:19:36.900 --> 02:19:39.260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: information, and to capture the database,

asr-003905
02:19:39.380 --> 02:19:39.600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: yun lang.

asr-003906
02:19:39.740 --> 02:19:43.360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, meron din itong component na matse-check

asr-003907
02:19:43.360 --> 02:19:44.880
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: kung may derogatory records,

asr-003908
02:19:45.000 --> 02:19:48.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: kung merong international fugitive

asr-003909
02:19:48.200 --> 02:19:52.180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: or international, ano ba ito, criminal.

asr-003910
02:19:52.180 --> 02:19:52.740
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, po.

asr-003911
02:19:52.760 --> 02:19:53.840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya ba itong mahuli?

asr-003912
02:19:54.200 --> 02:19:56.860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, magpupula ba yung e-gates

asr-003913
02:19:56.860 --> 02:19:57.980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: kung may problema?

asr-003914
02:19:58.260 --> 02:19:59.260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sige, konti lang.

asr-003915
02:19:59.960 --> 02:20:01.020
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Kaya po, Your Honor.

asr-003916
02:20:01.320 --> 02:20:04.420
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Pagsak na yung kulungan.

asr-003917
02:20:07.440 --> 02:20:08.440
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Pwede po, Your Honor.

asr-003918
02:20:08.740 --> 02:20:11.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Opo, naka-hook up rin po kami

asr-003919
02:20:11.220 --> 02:20:13.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: sa sistema po ng Interpol.

asr-003920
02:20:14.320 --> 02:20:15.620
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: International Police po, Your Honor.

asr-003921
02:20:15.920 --> 02:20:17.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, how many e-gates have been installed

asr-003922
02:20:17.580 --> 02:20:22.360
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and how will be our operation already?

asr-003923
02:20:22.360 --> 02:20:22.540
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes.

asr-003924
02:20:22.540 --> 02:20:26.700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I assume na yung major terminals natin,

asr-003925
02:20:26.760 --> 02:20:28.640
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: na iya 1, 2, 3,

asr-003926
02:20:29.400 --> 02:20:32.080
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and then siguro sa Ibu and Dabao.

asr-003927
02:20:32.260 --> 02:20:32.700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sige po.

asr-003928
02:20:33.100 --> 02:20:33.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-003929
02:20:34.620 --> 02:20:40.100
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Sa ano po, sa ating e-gates,

asr-003930
02:20:41.000 --> 02:20:44.740
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: meron pong donation which came from the private entity,

asr-003931
02:20:44.940 --> 02:20:45.440
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: NNIC.

asr-003932
02:20:45.720 --> 02:20:47.180
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So, na iya 1 and 3 po,

asr-003933
02:20:47.900 --> 02:20:49.640
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ano po yan, 78, Your Honors.

asr-003934
02:20:49.640 --> 02:20:51.940
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: And then, eventually po,

asr-003935
02:20:52.540 --> 02:20:53.040
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: sa donation,

asr-003936
02:20:53.380 --> 02:20:57.040
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: inilaan po namin yung budget po

asr-003937
02:20:57.040 --> 02:20:59.880
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: para doon sa originally T1 and T3

asr-003938
02:20:59.880 --> 02:21:02.440
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: sa ibang airports po sa buong Pilipinas.

asr-003939
02:21:02.660 --> 02:21:03.760
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa mga major airports.

asr-003940
02:21:03.920 --> 02:21:05.700
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Even, basta international airports,

asr-003941
02:21:05.840 --> 02:21:06.320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: lalagyan nyo.

asr-003942
02:21:06.720 --> 02:21:07.380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-003943
02:21:07.740 --> 02:21:09.240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, for the record,

asr-003944
02:21:09.400 --> 02:21:11.820
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: NNIC or the new na IA Infra Corporation

asr-003945
02:21:11.820 --> 02:21:13.460
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: donated about

asr-003946
02:21:13.460 --> 02:21:18.660
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: a few units for terminals 1 and 3

asr-003947
02:21:18.660 --> 02:21:19.680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ang nabanggit nyo.

asr-003948
02:21:19.680 --> 02:21:20.480
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Tama po, e-gates?

asr-003949
02:21:20.480 --> 02:21:21.960
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: That's correct, Your Honor.

asr-003950
02:21:22.540 --> 02:21:23.620
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Already being used, no?

asr-003951
02:21:23.780 --> 02:21:24.680
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes po, Your Honor.

asr-003952
02:21:25.640 --> 02:21:26.740
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Sa atin naman po,

asr-003953
02:21:26.880 --> 02:21:30.460
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: nakadeploy po yan sa Cebu, Clark, Bohol, Dabao,

asr-003954
02:21:30.600 --> 02:21:31.840
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: 47 e-gates po.

asr-003955
02:21:32.200 --> 02:21:33.600
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: And ang nabanggit ko po kanina,

asr-003956
02:21:33.700 --> 02:21:35.360
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: yung biometric capturing devices,

asr-003957
02:21:36.300 --> 02:21:38.460
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: na importante po makuha po yung information

asr-003958
02:21:38.460 --> 02:21:40.000
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: na kailangan po from the passenger,

asr-003959
02:21:40.480 --> 02:21:43.820
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: merong 57 po tayo na biometric capturing devices,

asr-003960
02:21:43.980 --> 02:21:44.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Your Honor.

asr-003961
02:21:44.380 --> 02:21:45.980
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, kung may whole departure order,

asr-003962
02:21:46.080 --> 02:21:46.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: for example,

asr-003963
02:21:47.660 --> 02:21:48.380
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: pupula ba yun?

asr-003964
02:21:48.680 --> 02:21:49.520
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Pupula po, Your Honor.

asr-003965
02:21:49.520 --> 02:21:52.280
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ah, hindi makakatuloy, Your Honor.

asr-003966
02:21:52.540 --> 02:21:55.000
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay, sige, marami kasi may HDO ngayon, eh.

asr-003967
02:21:55.080 --> 02:21:57.600
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, just want to make sure na, hindi...

asr-003968
02:21:57.600 --> 02:21:58.260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, ano?

asr-003969
02:21:59.360 --> 02:21:59.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Okay.

asr-003970
02:22:00.900 --> 02:22:01.260
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pupula.

asr-003971
02:22:01.340 --> 02:22:03.200
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasi nakita ko doon, ano, Mr. Chair,

asr-003972
02:22:03.300 --> 02:22:04.860
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: nandaming e-gates green, eh.

asr-003973
02:22:04.920 --> 02:22:05.840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ibig sabihin...

asr-003974
02:22:05.840 --> 02:22:06.380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Tuloy lang po.

asr-003975
02:22:06.500 --> 02:22:07.800
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Go yun, tuloy-tuloy lang.

asr-003976
02:22:07.900 --> 02:22:09.240
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, pag pumula, may problema.

asr-003977
02:22:09.460 --> 02:22:10.140
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes po, Your Honor.

asr-003978
02:22:11.300 --> 02:22:13.580
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Doon makakailanganin yung human intervention.

asr-003979
02:22:13.880 --> 02:22:14.520
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes po, Your Honor.

asr-003980
02:22:14.600 --> 02:22:15.620
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Taba po kayo ito, Your Honor.

asr-003981
02:22:16.760 --> 02:22:18.320
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, hindi naman babawasan, no,

asr-003982
02:22:18.320 --> 02:22:19.840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: yung mga immigration officers natin?

asr-003983
02:22:19.980 --> 02:22:20.640
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Hindi po, Your Honor.

asr-003984
02:22:20.640 --> 02:22:21.660
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: As a matter of fact,

asr-003985
02:22:21.660 --> 02:22:22.460
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ngayon po,

asr-003986
02:22:22.540 --> 02:22:24.320
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: kulang pa nga po tayo, Your Honor, eh.

asr-003987
02:22:24.440 --> 02:22:26.700
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: But we make do with whatever is given to us.

asr-003988
02:22:27.300 --> 02:22:29.480
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Initially, I've been reiterating po,

asr-003989
02:22:30.060 --> 02:22:31.740
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ang immigration officers po natin

asr-003990
02:22:31.740 --> 02:22:33.200
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: sa buong Pilipinas,

asr-003991
02:22:33.480 --> 02:22:36.340
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: around 1,800, 1,900.

asr-003992
02:22:37.300 --> 02:22:37.800
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ngayon po,

asr-003993
02:22:37.880 --> 02:22:39.880
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ikukumpira po natin yan sa ibang bansa

asr-003994
02:22:39.880 --> 02:22:41.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: na hindi naman po kasi laki

asr-003995
02:22:41.220 --> 02:22:44.300
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ng ating borders o teritoryo.

asr-003996
02:22:45.020 --> 02:22:48.240
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang Japan, I think, has about 5,000, 6,000, 7,000.

asr-003997
02:22:48.520 --> 02:22:49.300
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang Japan po yan.

asr-003998
02:22:49.920 --> 02:22:52.080
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Dati po, may nakausap po ko galing Singapore.

asr-003999
02:22:52.540 --> 02:22:54.540
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Nagtatakaw po siya, nung tinanong po niya,

asr-004000
02:22:54.540 --> 02:22:56.200
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ilan ang immigration officers niyon?

asr-004001
02:22:56.200 --> 02:22:58.200
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Sabi ko, less than 2,000 what?

asr-004002
02:22:58.200 --> 02:23:01.940
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: And considering na pagdating po sa land area,

asr-004003
02:23:01.940 --> 02:23:04.800
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: napakaliit po ng kanilang area,

asr-004004
02:23:04.800 --> 02:23:06.140
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: kukupira po sa atin.

asr-004005
02:23:06.140 --> 02:23:09.140
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: And we don't only have to contend with the land area,

asr-004006
02:23:09.140 --> 02:23:11.140
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: we have to contend with the coastal areas.

asr-004007
02:23:11.140 --> 02:23:17.140
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Milyon-milyon po ng metro kwadrado ang ating economic zone,

asr-004008
02:23:17.140 --> 02:23:19.140
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: exclusive economic zone po natin.

asr-004009
02:23:19.140 --> 02:23:20.240
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang coastal areas po natin,

asr-004010
02:23:20.240 --> 02:23:21.240
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: daan-libu po yan

asr-004011
02:23:21.240 --> 02:23:22.380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ng

asr-004012
02:23:22.380 --> 02:23:24.380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: kilometro kwadrado.

asr-004013
02:23:24.380 --> 02:23:26.380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So, we have to contend with that.

asr-004014
02:23:26.380 --> 02:23:32.380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: And I've been telling those who have been asking

asr-004015
02:23:32.380 --> 02:23:35.380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ang kinalakihan po natin nun,

asr-004016
02:23:35.380 --> 02:23:37.380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: 7,100 islands ang Pilipinas.

asr-004017
02:23:37.380 --> 02:23:39.380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ngayon po, 7,600 na.

asr-004018
02:23:39.380 --> 02:23:44.380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: And divide that with the number of officers that we have,

asr-004019
02:23:44.380 --> 02:23:49.380
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: on the average, one officer has to take care of four islands.

asr-004020
02:23:49.380 --> 02:23:52.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Meron ho mga instances kung naano eh,

asr-004021
02:23:52.220 --> 02:23:56.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: kala po namin nung una eh, parang, ano lang ho, hindi nangyayari.

asr-004022
02:23:56.220 --> 02:24:00.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: But I was able to talk to one officer in a single day.

asr-004023
02:24:00.220 --> 02:24:06.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: She went to four islands in one day just to check on the situation.

asr-004024
02:24:06.220 --> 02:24:08.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ganyan po ang ano.

asr-004025
02:24:08.220 --> 02:24:10.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So, kailangan po natin na mas marami ring officers yan.

asr-004026
02:24:10.220 --> 02:24:12.220
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Masama dun sa four islands ang island of Luzon.

asr-004027
02:24:14.220 --> 02:24:15.220
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay, go ahead.

asr-004028
02:24:17.220 --> 02:24:21.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung ano lang kasi, napansin ko lang when I visited na IA, no?

asr-004029
02:24:21.220 --> 02:24:25.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Because I also defend the budget of the OTR.

asr-004030
02:24:25.220 --> 02:24:27.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Nag-inspection kami dun recently.

asr-004031
02:24:27.220 --> 02:24:29.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I'm happy na ang dami ng e-gates, no?

asr-004032
02:24:29.220 --> 02:24:31.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kaya nakita ko yung green eh tsaka red eh.

asr-004033
02:24:31.220 --> 02:24:33.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Na mahirap yung lumalabas na red.

asr-004034
02:24:33.220 --> 02:24:40.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, anyway, ang meron lang common complaint is that,

asr-004035
02:24:40.220 --> 02:24:45.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: siguro just walk us through or kaya kung ano yung patakaran ngayon,

asr-004036
02:24:45.220 --> 02:24:49.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: pag foreigner, kailangan humarap sa immigration officer pa, no?

asr-004037
02:24:49.220 --> 02:24:50.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung arrival.

asr-004038
02:24:50.220 --> 02:24:51.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung arrival.

asr-004039
02:24:51.220 --> 02:24:54.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung mga Pilipino, pwedeng mag-e-gates na.

asr-004040
02:24:54.220 --> 02:24:55.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Your Honor, ano po?

asr-004041
02:24:55.220 --> 02:24:59.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Meron pong faces, Your Honor, if I can give you the schedule.

asr-004042
02:24:59.220 --> 02:25:01.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Tsaka yung ano lang siguro, just to complete, no?

asr-004043
02:25:01.220 --> 02:25:02.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: And before you mention.

asr-004044
02:25:02.220 --> 02:25:03.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes, sir.

asr-004045
02:25:03.220 --> 02:25:06.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yung ang problema kasi, yung departure,

asr-004046
02:25:06.220 --> 02:25:09.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: pag Pilipino, kailangan baliktad.

asr-004047
02:25:09.220 --> 02:25:12.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ang foreigner, e-gates ang pwedeng gumamit.

asr-004048
02:25:12.220 --> 02:25:16.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero ang Pilipino, kailangan dumaan sa immigration officer, baliktad, no?

asr-004049
02:25:16.220 --> 02:25:19.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, I understand because of the anti-yakat, no?

asr-004050
02:25:19.220 --> 02:25:21.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa anti-trafficking.

asr-004051
02:25:21.220 --> 02:25:26.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pero can you, Commissioner Joel, can you explain ito pong rational?

asr-004052
02:25:26.220 --> 02:25:27.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Bakit ganun?

asr-004053
02:25:27.220 --> 02:25:29.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pag parating, bakit na, anyway,

asr-004054
02:25:29.220 --> 02:25:35.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Senator Tulfo also brought this up during the DFA budget hearing,

asr-004055
02:25:35.220 --> 02:25:39.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: na pag parating, ang Pilipino lang ang pwedeng gumamit na e-gates.

asr-004056
02:25:39.220 --> 02:25:41.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Pag paalis naman, foreigner lang.

asr-004057
02:25:41.220 --> 02:25:44.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, can you elaborate?

asr-004058
02:25:44.220 --> 02:25:45.220
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Yes.

asr-004059
02:25:45.220 --> 02:25:47.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Meron po kaming nakaset po ng mga,

asr-004060
02:25:47.220 --> 02:25:55.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: naka-set po ng mga schedule pagdating po sa kung sino po ang pwedeng lumabas at maglabas-masok using the e-gates.

asr-004061
02:25:55.220 --> 02:26:00.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Noong ano po, noong December 2025, noong una po nating nilaunch po itong proyekto na to,

asr-004062
02:26:00.220 --> 02:26:05.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Filipinos po ang makakagamit upon arrival.

asr-004063
02:26:05.220 --> 02:26:14.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Noong February 2026 po, mga OFWs po natin, mga kababayan po nating OFWs, ang pwede na pong makagamit sa departure.

asr-004064
02:26:14.220 --> 02:26:16.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Pagdating naman po ng May 2026,

asr-004065
02:26:16.220 --> 02:26:24.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: yung mga temporary visitors eligible under the, or admitted under the, tinatawag po nating EO408,

asr-004066
02:26:24.220 --> 02:26:29.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: yung mga eligible countries with the 30-day visa-free arrangement,

asr-004067
02:26:29.220 --> 02:26:32.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: makakagamit na rin po sila sa departure.

asr-004068
02:26:32.220 --> 02:26:39.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Pagdating naman po noong June 2026, ang foreign nationals under the Balikbayanan Program,

asr-004069
02:26:39.220 --> 02:26:42.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: makakagamit po sila sa departure.

asr-004070
02:26:42.220 --> 02:26:46.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: At yun pong non-first-time travelers.

asr-004073
02:26:46.220 --> 02:26:50.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Kabila sa Pilipinos, departure din po noong June 2026.

asr-004074
02:26:50.220 --> 02:26:54.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: At yun pong mga registered po sa Commission on Filipinos Overseas.

asr-004075
02:26:54.220 --> 02:26:59.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Sa first quarter of 2027, ang schedule po natin,

asr-004076
02:26:59.220 --> 02:27:05.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: upon arrival, ang other eligible foreign nationals can use the E-gates.

asr-004077
02:27:05.220 --> 02:27:14.220
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Pagdating naman po ng second quarter ng 2027, other eligible foreign nationals can now use the departure gates.

asr-004078
02:27:14.220 --> 02:27:15.920
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yan po ang schedule, Your Honor.

asr-004079
02:27:16.240 --> 02:27:21.780
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: And tama po kayo pagdating po sa mga kababayan po natin na aalis,

asr-004080
02:27:22.220 --> 02:27:26.900
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: we have to comply with the departure formalities na tinatawag po

asr-004081
02:27:26.900 --> 02:27:30.300
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: as set under the Interagency Council Against Trafficking

asr-004082
02:27:30.300 --> 02:27:33.020
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: of which the Bureau of Immigration is one of the members.

asr-004083
02:27:33.020 --> 02:27:38.300
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: We have to consider, Your Honors, that the Philippines is uniquely situated

asr-004084
02:27:38.300 --> 02:27:43.200
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: in the sense that ang border control po natin does not only pertain to those arriving

asr-004085
02:27:43.200 --> 02:27:47.480
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: but ang mga kababayan po natin ay piniprotektahan po natin

asr-004086
02:27:47.480 --> 02:27:52.660
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: bago po sila umalis ng bansa just to ensure that they are safely,

asr-004087
02:27:53.300 --> 02:27:57.320
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: they safely not only arrive but they safely work in the countries

asr-004088
02:27:57.320 --> 02:27:59.240
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: where they intend to be employed.

asr-004089
02:27:59.340 --> 02:28:03.900
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Kaya po meron po mga proseso po kaming dinadaanan para humalaman

asr-004090
02:28:03.900 --> 02:28:08.920
