asr-004110
02:29:38.920 --> 02:29:43.680
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: We support the modernization of our border security system,

asr-004111
02:29:43.840 --> 02:29:47.080
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: but, ah, it should not be interpreted as an automatic approval

