02:29:57.000 --> 02:29:59.480
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: the technology, financial structure, and other.

asr-004115
02:30:00.000 --> 02:30:01.020
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: commercial terms.

asr-004116
02:30:01.620 --> 02:30:02.420
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: And the government,

