asr-004125
02:30:15.480 --> 02:30:17.180
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: and in the public interest.

asr-004126
02:30:18.080 --> 02:30:18.480
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ngayon po,

asr-004127
02:30:19.280 --> 02:30:21.360
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: do we think that it's in the public interest?

asr-004128
02:30:23.360 --> 02:30:26.880
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: We believe that it is a viable project

asr-004129
02:30:26.880 --> 02:30:28.740
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: which would strengthen

asr-004130
02:30:28.740 --> 02:30:31.320
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: border control and security.

asr-004131
02:30:32.160 --> 02:30:35.260
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: The CAIS is an integrated,

asr-004132
02:30:35.560 --> 02:30:36.680
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: intelligence-driven,

asr-004133
02:30:37.200 --> 02:30:39.360
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: border security system

asr-004134
02:30:39.360 --> 02:30:42.680
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: that combines advanced passenger information,

asr-004135
02:30:42.920 --> 02:30:43.360
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: merong biometrics,

asr-004136
02:30:44.120 --> 02:30:45.800
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: may automated immigration processing,

asr-004137
02:30:46.420 --> 02:30:47.500
