02:30:56.880 --> 02:30:57.820
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Initially po,

asr-004143
02:30:58.200 --> 02:31:00.300
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ang 10.7 billion po

