02:31:00.300 --> 02:31:03.460
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ang magagastos dito ng private proponent

asr-004145
02:31:03.460 --> 02:31:05.160
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: for this project.

