02:31:05.680 --> 02:31:08.780
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Now, in the next 20 years,

asr-004147
02:31:09.340 --> 02:31:10.680
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ang estimate po is

asr-004148
02:31:10.680 --> 02:31:12.340
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: mga 116 billion po

asr-004149
02:31:12.340 --> 02:31:14.680
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ang magagastos sila for operations, etc.

asr-004150
02:31:15.040 --> 02:31:16.640
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: For the hardware upgrade,

asr-004151
02:31:16.820 --> 02:31:20.100
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: it's about 52.2 billion

asr-004152
02:31:20.100 --> 02:31:21.780
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: for the next 20 years.

asr-004153
02:31:23.400 --> 02:31:25.880
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang objective po is to move

asr-004154
02:31:25.880 --> 02:31:26.780
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: the bureaucracy,

asr-004155
02:31:26.880 --> 02:31:29.120
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: from predominantly manual

asr-004156
02:31:29.120 --> 02:31:31.100
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: and reactive screening approach

asr-004157
02:31:31.100 --> 02:31:35.100
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: to a proactive risk-based control system.

asr-004158
02:31:36.780 --> 02:31:38.200
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: We have to contend po

asr-004159
02:31:38.200 --> 02:31:40.080
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: as international travel increases,

asr-004160
02:31:40.300 --> 02:31:42.100
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: nagiging masophisticated po yung methods

asr-004161
