BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: involving fraudulent documents,

asr-004162
02:31:44.500 --> 02:31:44.900
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: aliases,

asr-004163
02:31:45.720 --> 02:31:46.740
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: synthetic identities,

asr-004164
02:31:47.000 --> 02:31:47.680
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: human trafficking,

asr-004165
02:31:48.060 --> 02:31:48.360
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: terrorism,

asr-004166
