BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: while allowing legitimate,

asr-004173
02:32:02.880 --> 02:32:04.880
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: low-risk travelers to be processed

asr-004174
02:32:04.880 --> 02:32:05.880
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: more efficiently.

asr-004175
02:32:05.880 --> 02:32:06.880
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ngayon po,

asr-004176
02:32:06.880 --> 02:32:07.880
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ang konsepto po nito is

asr-004177
02:32:07.880 --> 02:32:11.880
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: we are expanding the borders.

asr-004178
02:32:11.880 --> 02:32:13.880
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Meaning, hindi lang po sa physical borders

asr-004179
02:32:13.880 --> 02:32:15.880
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: na ho natin makokontrol,

asr-004180
02:32:15.880 --> 02:32:19.880
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: but even before they board the plane,

asr-004181
02:32:19.880 --> 02:32:21.880
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: alam na po natin kung pwedeng,

asr-004182
02:32:21.880 --> 02:32:24.880
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: dapat ba silang papasukay nung hindi.

asr-004183
02:32:24.880 --> 02:32:26.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yan po yung konsepto nung

asr-004184
02:32:26.720 --> 02:32:27.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: kais, Your Honor.

