02:32:46.720 --> 02:32:48.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: is this part,

asr-004194
02:32:48.720 --> 02:32:50.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: is the information part of this project?

asr-004195
02:32:50.720 --> 02:32:51.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-004196
02:32:51.720 --> 02:32:54.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Kasama ho dyan ang analytics ng muka

asr-004197
02:32:54.720 --> 02:32:56.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: na nakikita po natin sa internet.

asr-004198
02:32:56.720 --> 02:32:58.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So billions of faces ho makikita dyan.

asr-004199
02:32:58.720 --> 02:33:00.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Meron din hong naka,

asr-004200
02:33:00.720 --> 02:33:01.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: naka ano po yan,

asr-004201
02:33:01.720 --> 02:33:03.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: nakakonekta sa Interpol database

asr-004202
02:33:03.720 --> 02:33:08.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: and other databases ho na relevant po dito sa ano po,

asr-004203
02:33:08.720 --> 02:33:11.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: kung kailangan papasukin ng isang individual o hindi.

