BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So based on information provided to us,

asr-004214
02:33:36.720 --> 02:33:40.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: they operate the system with other partners

asr-004215
02:33:40.720 --> 02:33:43.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: within four major cities po.

asr-004216
02:33:43.720 --> 02:33:47.720
