BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Advanced Passenger Information System.

asr-004234
02:34:22.720 --> 02:34:23.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ngayon po,

asr-004235
02:34:23.720 --> 02:34:25.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: bago pa po mag-board,

asr-004236
02:34:25.720 --> 02:34:29.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: pagka nagbigay na po ng manifesto ang isang aeroplano,

asr-004237
02:34:29.720 --> 02:34:32.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: pag sakay po ng isang tao sa airport,

asr-004238
02:34:32.720 --> 02:34:35.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: doon sa aeroplano po sa airport,

asr-004239
02:34:35.720 --> 02:34:37.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: on the way or in transit,

asr-004240
02:34:37.720 --> 02:34:39.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ibabato na po sa amin yung information.

asr-004241
02:34:39.720 --> 02:34:43.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So malalaman po namin kung isa pong tao ay dapat papasukin sa atin.

asr-004242
02:34:43.720 --> 02:34:45.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So we have been using this system

asr-004243
02:34:45.720 --> 02:34:47.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: na-exclude po ang ibang,

asr-004244
02:34:47.720 --> 02:34:50.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: marami na pong mga nagtatangka rito magtago,

asr-004245
02:34:50.720 --> 02:34:52.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: o mga pugante po,

asr-004246
02:34:52.720 --> 02:34:55.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: o fugitives from other countries.

asr-004247
02:34:55.720 --> 02:34:57.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ito pong system ng CAIS

asr-004248
02:34:57.720 --> 02:34:59.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: will integrate and

asr-004249
02:34:59.720 --> 02:35:02.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: also improve upon that system.

asr-004250
02:35:02.720 --> 02:35:05.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So pagka dito sa CAIS project po,

asr-004251
