BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: posted it on the web,

asr-004254
02:35:13.720 --> 02:35:17.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: terroristic yung kanyang tendency or activity,

asr-004255
02:35:17.720 --> 02:35:20.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: the system can read that.

asr-004256
02:35:22.720 --> 02:35:25.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ang ano rin dito, may gastusin ba tayo rito?

asr-004257
02:35:25.720 --> 02:35:27.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Or is this entirely PPP?

asr-004258
