BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ito po integrative, Your Honor.

asr-004266
02:35:48.720 --> 02:35:51.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Iintegrate po dito yung iba't ibang systems

asr-004267
02:35:51.720 --> 02:35:55.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: that we are currently enjoying or using, Your Honor.

asr-004268
02:35:55.720 --> 02:35:58.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ito po kasi, ang sa atin ngayon,

asr-004269
02:35:58.720 --> 02:36:01.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: manual, manually based, reactive.

asr-004270
02:36:01.720 --> 02:36:05.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ito po proactive, meaning bago pa ho dumating sa mga borders natin,

asr-004271
02:36:05.720 --> 02:36:08.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: based on the information available on the web,

asr-004272
02:36:08.720 --> 02:36:12.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: based on the information available or given to us

asr-004273
02:36:12.720 --> 02:36:14.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: or integrated with our system,

asr-004274
02:36:14.720 --> 02:36:17.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: na available sa iba't ibang bansa and other agencies

asr-004275
02:36:17.720 --> 02:36:20.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: dito sa Pilipinas, we can determine

asr-004276
02:36:20.720 --> 02:36:25.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: the, not the capability, not only the capability,

asr-004277
02:36:25.720 --> 02:36:30.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: but the, if, whether or not we will admit a person

asr-004278
02:36:30.720 --> 02:36:35.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: or that person is privileged enough to enter the Philippines.

asr-004279
02:36:35.720 --> 02:36:37.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yan po ang ano, yan po ang sistema na.

asr-004280
02:36:37.720 --> 02:36:39.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: That's a very good, that's very good news.

asr-004281
02:36:39.720 --> 02:36:41.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At least, ano na ngayon, no?

asr-004282
02:36:41.720 --> 02:36:44.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: The use of technology, we can already monitor those

asr-004283
02:36:44.720 --> 02:36:46.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: that were incoming pa lang,

asr-004284
02:36:46.720 --> 02:36:47.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-004285
02:36:47.720 --> 02:36:48.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: and those outgoing.

asr-004286
02:36:48.720 --> 02:36:49.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Lalo na kung,

asr-004287
02:36:49.720 --> 02:36:51.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: terrorist ba yan o fugitive.

asr-004288
02:36:51.720 --> 02:36:56.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: At least, those undesirable aliens will not be allowed anymore to enter.

asr-004289
02:36:56.720 --> 02:36:57.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-004290
02:36:57.720 --> 02:37:00.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Wang ano lang, tanong lang, Mr. Chair, dahil ito'y PPP,

asr-004291
02:37:00.720 --> 02:37:03.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: paano sila, paano babawiin ang proponent

asr-004292
02:37:03.720 --> 02:37:08.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: or how will they, ano po ang income dito?

asr-004293
02:37:08.720 --> 02:37:11.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Since it's a public-private partnership.

asr-004294
02:37:11.720 --> 02:37:12.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-004295
02:37:12.720 --> 02:37:14.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Meron pong proposed service fee,

asr-004296
02:37:14.720 --> 02:37:17.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: which amounts to $4 per travel,

asr-004297
02:37:17.720 --> 02:37:20.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: per ano po, per kada biyahe po.

asr-004298
02:37:20.720 --> 02:37:22.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So that's approximately about,

asr-004299
02:37:22.720 --> 02:37:24.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: One entry?

asr-004300
02:37:24.720 --> 02:37:26.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ano po, for one travel po.

asr-004301
02:37:26.720 --> 02:37:31.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Kung round trip po yan, that's eight US dollars.

asr-004302
02:37:31.720 --> 02:37:33.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes po.

asr-004303
02:37:33.720 --> 02:37:38.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So that's approximately a little over 240 pesos.

asr-004304
02:37:38.720 --> 02:37:42.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: But if you can compare that to other countries,

asr-004305
02:37:42.720 --> 02:37:44.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: sa ibang bansa po kasi,

asr-004306
02:37:44.720 --> 02:37:46.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Australia charges about 2,600.

asr-004307
02:37:46.720 --> 02:37:48.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: I was supposed to ask that,

asr-004308
02:37:48.720 --> 02:37:50.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: how does it compare to other countries, yung rates?

asr-004309
02:37:50.720 --> 02:37:51.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes po, Your Honor.

asr-004310
02:37:51.720 --> 02:37:53.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So paano sa ibang bansa, mas mata?

asr-004311
02:37:53.720 --> 02:37:55.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang pinakamababa nga po, Your Honor,

asr-004312
02:37:55.720 --> 02:37:59.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: would be Japan, that's about 1,100 pesos,

asr-004313
02:37:59.720 --> 02:38:01.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: as compared to 242 sa atin.

asr-004314
02:38:01.720 --> 02:38:04.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang Hong Kong charges about 1,400, 1,500.

asr-004315
02:38:04.720 --> 02:38:07.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang Thailand, around 1,800.

asr-004316
02:38:07.720 --> 02:38:10.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang Australia, 2,600.

asr-004317
02:38:10.720 --> 02:38:11.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So ganyan po ang range.

asr-004318
02:38:11.720 --> 02:38:13.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang Singapore is about 2,400.

asr-004319
02:38:13.720 --> 02:38:15.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So yan po ang, ano po,

asr-004320
02:38:15.720 --> 02:38:18.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: yan po ang range ng mga sinisigil po ng ibang bansa.

asr-004321
02:38:18.720 --> 02:38:20.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Maaring hindi po natin halita.

asr-004322
02:38:20.720 --> 02:38:24.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Pero naka-integrate po yan sa, sa ano po natin, sa ticket.

asr-004323
02:38:24.720 --> 02:38:26.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Sa airline ticket.

asr-004324
02:38:26.720 --> 02:38:29.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So tayo ngayon, walang charge?

asr-004325
02:38:29.720 --> 02:38:32.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Wala po tayong sinacharge, Your Honor.

asr-004326
02:38:32.720 --> 02:38:35.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Parang ano rito, you know, kasi there's such a thing doon

asr-004327
02:38:35.720 --> 02:38:37.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: sa pag may financial company ka or banks,

asr-004328
02:38:37.720 --> 02:38:39.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: yung Credit Investigation Bureau.

asr-004329
02:38:39.720 --> 02:38:44.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: You pay, you, for a fee, you can get information, no?

asr-004330
02:38:44.720 --> 02:38:48.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Para sa mga credit, sa mga credit, sa mga banks, financial institutions.

asr-004331
02:38:48.720 --> 02:38:52.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So ito, parang in international community,

asr-004332
02:38:52.720 --> 02:38:57.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: baka kakakuha kayong information about persons, no?

asr-004333
02:38:57.720 --> 02:39:02.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: About yung kanila pong records, especially kung terrorism

asr-004334
02:39:02.720 --> 02:39:05.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: o ano man ang kanilang records, international records.

asr-004335
02:39:05.720 --> 02:39:06.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ito ba yun, ah?

asr-004336
02:39:06.720 --> 02:39:08.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: That's part of it na yung database?

asr-004337
02:39:08.720 --> 02:39:09.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-004338
02:39:09.720 --> 02:39:11.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So ano to?

asr-004339
02:39:11.720 --> 02:39:15.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Also for the protection and safety of everyone, no?

asr-004340
02:39:15.720 --> 02:39:16.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-004341
02:39:16.720 --> 02:39:20.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Your Honor, as a matter of fact, we directed the private proponent

asr-004342
02:39:20.720 --> 02:39:24.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: to commence with the public consultation process.

asr-004343
02:39:24.720 --> 02:39:27.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: So ibig sabihin, ang mechanics po niyan, inaayos na po nila.

asr-004344
02:39:27.720 --> 02:39:32.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Ang sabi nga po namin sa kanila, mag-ano tayo, magkaroon kayo ng, ah,

asr-004345
02:39:32.720 --> 02:39:39.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: ng public na ano, na, na paggamit po para masubukan po ng mga nakaka, ano po,

asr-004346
02:39:39.720 --> 02:39:43.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: nag-interesado at nakakalam kung paano po nag-working system.

asr-004347
02:39:43.720 --> 02:39:45.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: We're actually working on that.

asr-004348
02:39:45.720 --> 02:39:47.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: The proponent has been directed to do that, Your Honor.

asr-004349
02:39:47.720 --> 02:39:49.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But it's still under evaluation, no? I presume.

asr-004350
02:39:49.720 --> 02:39:50.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-004351
02:39:50.720 --> 02:39:51.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, Your Honor.

asr-004352
02:39:51.720 --> 02:39:53.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: It's still under evaluation.

asr-004353
02:39:53.720 --> 02:39:55.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: It's still under contract, technical review.

asr-004354
02:39:55.720 --> 02:40:01.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: It's still undergoing the review process with the PPP Center, with the DOJ,

asr-004355
02:40:01.720 --> 02:40:04.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: with the Bureau of Immigration, Your Honor.

asr-004356
02:40:04.720 --> 02:40:07.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasi baka mamaya sabihin ng mga pasahero,

asr-004357
02:40:07.720 --> 02:40:08.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: tatanggal.

asr-004358
02:40:08.720 --> 02:40:10.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Tatanggal niyang travel tax, may bagong fee.

asr-004359
02:40:10.720 --> 02:40:15.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But this will be, will this be charged to passengers?

asr-004360
02:40:15.720 --> 02:40:18.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Sa mga travelers po, Your Honor.

asr-004361
02:40:18.720 --> 02:40:19.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa mga travelers?

asr-004362
02:40:19.720 --> 02:40:20.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: It's a service fee, Yes, Your Honor.

asr-004363
02:40:20.720 --> 02:40:21.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Service fee?

asr-004364
02:40:21.720 --> 02:40:22.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes po.

asr-004365
02:40:22.720 --> 02:40:24.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: But under, it's now under evaluation?

asr-004366
02:40:24.720 --> 02:40:27.720
BI Commissioner Joel Anthony M. Viado: Yes, po. It's under evaluation, Your Honor.

asr-004367
02:40:27.720 --> 02:40:29.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Okay, ah, thank you.

asr-004368
02:40:29.720 --> 02:40:33.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Siguro, Mr. Chair, thank you sa Commissioner Joel for at least na-elaborate niyo

asr-004369
02:40:33.720 --> 02:40:36.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: lalo niyo sa E-Gates issue and lahat sa KAIS.

asr-004370
02:40:36.720 --> 02:40:37.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Ahm.

asr-004371
02:40:37.720 --> 02:40:41.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Doon sa Witness Protection Program, siguro, ahm, ano lang, ahm,

asr-004372
02:40:41.720 --> 02:40:44.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: sik, no, yung, just like to us as Chair of Committee on Finance,

asr-004373
02:40:44.720 --> 02:40:47.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: ah, yung siguro na-recommend naman ating Vice Chair,

asr-004374
02:40:47.720 --> 02:40:50.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: yung pong, ah, yung inyong pong ano rito,

asr-004375
02:40:50.720 --> 02:40:54.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: yung inyong budget for your Witness Protection Program,

asr-004376
02:40:54.720 --> 02:40:57.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: is it enough already for 20, 27?

asr-004377
02:40:57.720 --> 02:41:01.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Considering na medyo marami tayong tinatanggap dito, no?

asr-004378
02:41:01.720 --> 02:41:03.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, magkano bang budget natin ngayong taon?

asr-004379
02:41:03.720 --> 02:41:05.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Magkano ang proposed budget next year?

asr-004380
02:41:05.720 --> 02:41:07.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Para dito?

asr-004381
02:41:07.720 --> 02:41:13.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Kasi, parang sa aming pagtingin, walang, essentially, walang change, walang dagdag, walang bawas, no?

asr-004382
02:41:13.720 --> 02:41:15.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, sa nabanggit.

asr-004383
02:41:15.720 --> 02:41:22.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, pero meron kayong additional request sa 500 million pero hindi na ibigay ng DBM, tama ba?

asr-004384
02:41:22.720 --> 02:41:30.720
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Ang, the biggest part na nawala po dito is yung confidential fund, oh.

asr-004385
02:41:30.720 --> 02:41:33.720
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Kasi we're, we're working on a budget of around 500 million for 2026.

asr-004386
02:41:33.720 --> 02:41:45.720
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: We will be really hard-pressed to continue with the same level of scaling yung aming engagements.

asr-004387
02:41:45.720 --> 02:41:47.720
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Ongoing engagements, that's a problem po.

asr-004388
02:41:47.720 --> 02:41:55.720
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: So, if we can go back to 2026 levels, Your Honors, that's the basic request, Your Honor.

asr-004389
02:41:55.720 --> 02:41:59.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, ang wish niyo is just to go back to 2026 levels?

asr-004390
02:41:59.720 --> 02:42:01.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 2026 levels.

asr-004391
02:42:01.720 --> 02:42:02.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 2026 levels.

asr-004392
02:42:02.720 --> 02:42:03.720
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: 2026 levels.

asr-004393
02:42:03.720 --> 02:42:04.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: 2026 levels.

asr-004394
02:42:04.720 --> 02:42:11.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, I would like to ask, Secretary, because I want to know whether the department is anticipating more additional state witnesses,

asr-004395
02:42:11.720 --> 02:42:18.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: kasi alam ko ginagastusan ninyo rin ito, particularly in connection with the flood control investigations, no?

asr-004396
02:42:18.720 --> 02:42:20.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Medyo na marami rin ito eh.

asr-004397
02:42:20.720 --> 02:42:27.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, yun pong, just like to ask, may dagdag ba tayo o sapat na ang kasalukuyang budget?

asr-004398
02:42:27.720 --> 02:42:31.720
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: These are variables that we cannot foretell or predict, Your Honor.

asr-004399
02:42:31.720 --> 02:42:32.720
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Yes.

asr-004400
02:42:32.720 --> 02:42:39.720
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: So, given the current system we have, we will be able to take on more witnesses if necessary.

asr-004401
02:42:39.720 --> 02:42:47.720
DOJ Secretary Fredderick A. Vida: Sanay naman po ang Department of Justice yan at yung program natin na pag maikli ang kumot po, babaluktot na lang po.

asr-004402
02:42:47.720 --> 02:42:57.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Speaking of state witnesses, ano po ba ang malino na kriteriya bago i-admit ang mga accused bilang state witness?

asr-004403
02:42:57.720 --> 02:43:00.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: If I may ask, PG Dong, who's...

asr-004404
02:43:00.720 --> 02:43:04.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: PG Dong, lagi naman itong suki dito.

asr-004405
02:43:04.720 --> 02:43:13.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, aside from the value of testimony and evidence they can provide, do you consider the extent na kanilang participation sa krimen, kung magkano ang kanilang ibabalik?

asr-004406
02:43:13.720 --> 02:43:15.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: So, siguro, PG Dong, please.

asr-004407
02:43:15.720 --> 02:43:28.720
Prosecutor General Richard Anthony Fadullon: Yes, with the permission of the Secretary, Mr. Chair, yung doon muna sa issue po kung ano yung qualifications, kailangan po, hindi po lahat ng tao na nag-a-apply sa program are automatically admitted.

asr-004408
02:43:28.720 --> 02:43:38.720
Prosecutor General Richard Anthony Fadullon: There are certain qualifications among them. Number one, that the person, well, the case involves a grave, one where the penalty is a grave penalty.

asr-004409
02:43:38.720 --> 02:43:52.720
Prosecutor General Richard Anthony Fadullon: Number two, it also entails na yung sasabihin ng tao is substantially relevant, meron siyang kahalagahan doon sa kaso, and it can be corroborated on most of its material points.

asr-004410
02:43:52.720 --> 02:43:57.720
Prosecutor General Richard Anthony Fadullon: So, lastly, hindi siya yung pinaka-guilty doon sa kaso.

asr-004411
02:43:58.720 --> 02:44:08.720
Prosecutor General Richard Anthony Fadullon: Sa usapin naman po nung pagsasoli, hindi po yan nakasaad sa ating batas. It's not categorically stated that there is restitution.

asr-004412
02:44:08.720 --> 02:44:26.720
Prosecutor General Richard Anthony Fadullon: However, during po, kung halimbawa, after the evaluation at nakita na itong potential applicant is qualified, then ang mangyayari po is magkakaroon po sila ng kasunduan, a memorandum of agreement that will be signed between the applicant and the Secretary of Justice.

asr-004413
02:44:26.720 --> 02:44:46.080
Prosecutor General Richard Anthony Fadullon: Doon po, meron pong mga kondisyon o meron pong mga kasunduan na maaaring ilahad. At doon na po papasok yung usapin kung meron po tayong mga makukuha o meron silang isusoli bilang bahagi nung kanilang pag-a-apply po o pag-a-apply nila sa ating programa.

asr-004414
02:44:50.720 --> 02:44:55.840
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: May madadagdag pa pa tayo, Sek? Siguro quickly, dahil marami nagtatanong pa rito sa flood control.

asr-004415
02:44:56.720 --> 02:45:00.720
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Sa mga makakasuhan na mga contractors,

asr-004416
02:45:00.000 --> 02:45:07.580
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: congressmen, kasi po, pasensya na po, pero yung cong-tractors, marami rito, ito yung mga nagsimula ng modus eh.

asr-004417
02:45:08.280 --> 02:45:14.180
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: Inaantay natin kung kailan sila matutuloyan dahil ayaw natin maulit muli ito.

asr-004418
02:45:20.800 --> 02:45:25.520
Prosecutor General Richard Anthony Fadullon: Well, sir, yung tulad po na sinabi ni Secretary of Justice, marami hung variables eh.

asr-004419
02:45:25.600 --> 02:45:29.280
Prosecutor General Richard Anthony Fadullon: Kasi even during the time when the cases are already filed in court,

asr-004420
02:45:30.000 --> 02:45:34.660
Prosecutor General Richard Anthony Fadullon: maari pong magpa-discharge pa rin ng isang akusado to become a state witness.

asr-004421
02:45:35.200 --> 02:45:39.040
Prosecutor General Richard Anthony Fadullon: And as a consequence, they are being admitted or asked to be admitted sa program.

asr-004422
02:45:39.620 --> 02:45:44.720
Prosecutor General Richard Anthony Fadullon: So yan po eh, depende sa kung ano po ang may dadagdag o may tutulong ng testimonya.

asr-004423
02:45:45.300 --> 02:45:49.480
